---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<Layout
  noindex={true}
  title="Proof and Claim Posture | Architecture | ByteLite LLC"
  description="How ByteLite LLC gates public claims: the claim ladder from Concept to Product, and what is explicitly not claimed."
  keywords="proof-gated claims, claim ladder, ByteLite LLC architecture"
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <section class="section-sm">
    <div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Architecture', href: '/architecture' }, { label: 'Proof and Claim Posture' }]} /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="cp-hero">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Architecture</p>
      <h1>Proof and Claim Posture</h1>
      <p class="cp-sub">Proof before claim.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;text-align:center;">
      <img src="/cordel-connect/icons/verified-shield-heart.svg" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="eager" style="opacity:.85;" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:1.75rem;">The claim ladder.</h2>
      <div class="cp-ladder">
        <div class="cp-rung"><div class="cp-rung-label">Concept</div><div class="cp-rung-note">Not a prototype.</div></div>
        <div class="cp-rung"><div class="cp-rung-label">Prototype</div><div class="cp-rung-note">Not a proof.</div></div>
        <div class="cp-rung"><div class="cp-rung-label">Proof Artifact</div><div class="cp-rung-note">Not a production product.</div></div>
        <div class="cp-rung"><div class="cp-rung-label">Validation</div><div class="cp-rung-note">Not a public benchmark.</div></div>
        <div class="cp-rung"><div class="cp-rung-label">Product</div><div class="cp-rung-note">Public claim with evidence.</div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="cp-p" style="margin-top:1.75rem;">
        A clean roundtrip is not universal compression. An internal proof is not a public benchmark.
        A reasoning architecture is not finished AGI. A product vision is not deployed infrastructure.
        This does not weaken the company — it makes the company harder to attack.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">What this is not.</h2>
      <div class="cp-not-grid">
        <div class="cp-not-item"><span class="cp-not-x">&#10005;</span>A public claim that every file compresses.</div>
        <div class="cp-not-item"><span class="cp-not-x">&#10005;</span>A public claim that a finished AGI product exists.</div>
        <div class="cp-not-item"><span class="cp-not-x">&#10005;</span>An LLM prediction compressor.</div>
        <div class="cp-not-item"><span class="cp-not-x">&#10005;</span>A black-box agent with unrestricted tools.</div>
        <div class="cp-not-item"><span class="cp-not-x">&#10005;</span>An ethics sticker placed on top of unsafe autonomy.</div>
        <div class="cp-not-item"><span class="cp-not-x">&#10005;</span>A promise that every planned layer is already production-ready.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;text-align:center;">
      <a href="/progress" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-right:.75rem;">View Current Status</a>
      <a href="/architecture" class="btn btn-outline">Back to the Complete Architecture</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

<style>
.cp-hero { padding: 4.5rem 0 3.5rem; }
.cp-sub { margin-top: .75rem; font-size: 1.0625rem; color: #7b829e; font-style: italic; }
.cp-p { font-size: 1.0625rem; color: #a0a8c0; line-height: 1.8; }
.cp-ladder { display: flex; gap: 0; border: 1px solid #1a2235; border-radius: .75rem; overflow: hidden; }
@media (max-width: 600px) { .cp-ladder { flex-direction: column; } }
.cp-rung { flex: 1; padding: 1.25rem 1rem; text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid #1a2235; background: rgba(99,102,241,.04); }
.cp-rung:last-child { border-right: none; }
.cp-rung-label { font-size: .8125rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e4e7f2; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
.cp-rung-note { font-size: .75rem; color: #555e7a; }
.cp-not-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .75rem; background: #0d1120; border: 1px solid #1a2235; border-radius: .75rem; padding: 1.75rem; }
.cp-not-item { display: flex; gap: .875rem; align-items: flex-start; font-size: .9375rem; color: #7b829e; }
.cp-not-x { color: #f87171; flex-shrink: 0; }
</style>
